{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"log_hardwood","model_identifier":"log_hardwood","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## log_hardwood\n\nCarried load, wood.\n\n- Cubes: 4 (0 rotated). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -2.0..7.0, y 0.0..7.0, z -20.0..20.0 (size 9.0 x 7.0 x 40.0 u = 25 x 20 x 112 cm).\nLog (dark, rough hardwood bark), 1.15 m long (40 u), ~20 cm thick: two crossed cubes so it reads round, end-grain rings on both ends, a knot and a branch stub. Origin = **slot_shoulder_r** (top of the right shoulder): the load rests on the shoulder (bottom at y = 0) and lies along Z, balanced over the slot, its centre ~2.5 u outboard of the slot so it clears the head. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = -0.0.\n"},"description":"## log_hardwood\n\nCarried load, wood.\n\n- Cubes: 4 (0 rotated). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -2.0..7.0, y 0.0..7.0, z -20.0..20.0 (size 9.0 x 7.0 x 40.0 u = 25 x 20 x 112 cm).\nLog (dark, rough hardwood bark), 1.15 m long (40 u), ~20 cm thick: two crossed cubes so it reads round, end-grain rings on both ends, a knot and a branch stub. Origin = **slot_shoulder_r** (top of the right shoulder): the load rests on the shoulder (bottom at y = 0) and lies along Z, balanced over the slot, its centre ~2.5 u outboard of the slot so it clears the head. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = -0.0.\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"log","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.0,0.0,-20.0],"to":[6.0,7.0,20.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[40,47,47.0,54.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,40,40.0,47.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[4